Create a new virtual environment for dbt

{noformat}python -m venv dbt-env{noformat}

Activate the clean environment

{noformat}source ./dbt-env/bin/activate{noformat}

Install requirements from file

{noformat}pip install -r requirements.txt{noformat}

In (each) dbt project folder.

Clean and update dbt deps

{noformat}dbt clean{noformat}

{noformat}dbt deps{noformat}



